name: Operation Request
type: Coordination/Request
description: >
  Request to invoke one named operation through one effective channel. The
  enclosing Timeline Entry supplies actor attribution and any mandate-backed
  authority. A feeder verifies source-channel eligibility, mandate authority,
  and document-version constraints before passing the entry to a processor.

operation:
  type: Text
  schema:
    required: true
  description: Required operation contract key/name to invoke.

channel:
  type: Text
  schema:
    required: true
  description: Required effective target channel key.

document:
  description: >
    Optional current target document state on which the invocation is based.
    The value may be materialized or represented by an equivalent pure BlueId
    reference.

requireExactDocumentVersion:
  type: Boolean
  description: >
    When true, the feeder passes the request only if document equals the current
    target state. When false or absent, a newer state may be accepted according
    to operation-matching rules.

request:
  description: Operation-specific request payload.
